msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: synnet\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-09-04 03:13-0500\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-09-03 00:15-0500\n"
"Last-Translator: Automatically generated\n"
